{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","巨斧劈杀"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","持巨斧猛砸，破坏区域内阻挡。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","举起斧头蓄力，片刻后砸向目标所在的格子，破坏以目标为中心2格半径内的阻挡，并对范围内敌人造成12% + 2% HP伤害，同时击飞敌人1秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":54,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":46,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至14% + 2% HP。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至16% + 2% HP。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至18% + 2% HP。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至20% + 2% HP。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","冲锋号令"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤虚影破坏区域内阻挡。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，召唤5格宽度的自身虚影朝敌方阵营方向冲锋，破坏沿途的阻挡，对敌人造成10% HP伤害，并鼓舞沿途的所有友军。赞东和被鼓舞的其他友军分别永久提升50% + 5%和20% + 2%最大生命值（当前生命值保持不变），并在后续的8秒内提升40 + 4点生命汲取，20点急速与100%移动速度。\n主动使用时，鼓舞周围2格范围内的友军，使其获得25 + 4点生命汲取和14点急速，持续8秒，不可叠加。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":80,"end":85,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":89,"end":94,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"},{"start":123,"end":127,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":174,"end":178,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，友军获得30 + 4点生命汲取和16点急速。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，友军获得35 + 4点生命汲取和18点急速。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，友军获得40 + 4点生命汲取和20点急速。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","征服之踏"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","使用强有力的马蹄践踏周围的敌人。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对一格范围内的敌人造成自身最大生命值12% + 1.5%伤害，并眩晕1.5秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成自身最大生命值伤害提升至13% + 1.5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成自身最大生命值伤害提升至14% + 1.5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成自身最大生命值伤害提升至15% + 1.5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升自身最大生命值，“冲锋号令”期间额外提升最大生命值。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，最大生命值提升12%，自身受到“冲锋号令”鼓舞期间最大生命值额外提升6%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，最大生命值提升18%，自身受到“冲锋号令”鼓舞期间最大生命值额外提升9%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，最大生命值提升24%，自身受到“冲锋号令”鼓舞期间最大生命值额外提升12%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","猎敌回响"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","普通攻击附加最大生命值伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","赞东的生命值高于50%初始最大生命值时，普通攻击附加自身最大生命值4%的伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至自身最大生命值5%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","受到“冲锋号令”鼓舞的友方角色在下一次普通攻击时，附带15%他们最大生命值的额外伤害，该伤害最高不超过赞东最大生命值的100%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至自身最大生命值6%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","溢出治疗转化为最大生命。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自身受到治疗时，溢出的部分将转化为最大生命值，提升的最大生命值至多不超过50%初始最大生命值。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","放逐之怒"]]}